  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd really like to have contact receivers able to interact with the world itself, as well as local player capsules. This would open up a lot of potential. \n\nA few things I can think of are wall detection, for things like wall-running animations, swords that will stick into walls when dropped in them via world constraints, but would fall to the ground as a physics object of they are floating in the air.",
